                                                "sense_id": "1f2bcb6b-0b5f-35b7-9adf-af17cd12b17a",
                                                "text": "Gremlinesque behaviour might not be very obvious to an America, who would accept as perfectly natural the quaintly pixilated sayings and doings that are happening in subways, in trolleys, on buses, in bars at all times of the day and night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
